{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつぽ\n卒業おめでとうの\nコメントありがとうございます(๑•̀ •́)و✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校卒業したら\n時間の制限もかわってくるし\nもっと活躍する場が増えたらいいなっ・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今年は、\n特にラジオやTVやネット番組等で\nトークする仕事と\nグラビアやモデルとか雑誌のお仕事が\n個人的にもっと出来たらなって思ってるよ(｡･ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなアイドルやお笑いやバンド、\nクリエーターさんに関わることもやりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとこれはいつかの話だけど、ヴィレッジヴァンガードさんと仕事したい(神になりたい)あと自己発信する番組作りたい(ショールーム的)あと大森靖子さんと共演したい松井玲奈さんと趣味合いすぎるので対談したい有吉反省会で反省したい柴田理恵さんみたいになりたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ\n明日、明後日は\nせいらりんの卒業コンサート！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんが卒業って感じがしなさ過ぎて\nまだ不思議なきもちのわたし○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山思い出が作れるよう\n盛り上がっていきましょー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「せいらりん」コールと\n「カワゴ」コールも宜しくね(｡･ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりでせっせと\n文字をかいた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＨＩＮＡ & ＹＵＲＩ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"藻であんまりゆうりが読めないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いがいと可愛いこともするんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/18/1227246/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}